  "description": "It's love at first sight for Karel when he sees the bedraggled but beautiful Sasya during his travels. Although Karel offers him food and lodging, Sasya slips away without leaving any hints about his identity. But fate pulls them back together when Karel finds a photo of Sasya in a Russian duke's home, and tracks him down in Paris. Once he learns Sasya is a talented ballerino who fled Russia under difficult circumstances, Karel takes him in with the help of his wealthy friend, Julian. However, Sasya knows Julian's sponsorship offer only stands as long as Karel stays interested in him... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes nine side story chapters.*",
